This repository is a portfolio case study. It documents the design and
engineering of Reconnect.iA (https://app.reconnectia.es), operated by
CeSeA Sistemas.

Contents:
  - platform/  a curated selection of platform modules and their tests.
               The rest of the application source is NOT included.
  - docs/      screenshots of the product with made-up data, brand assets
               and generated progress cards.

The Reconnect.iA name, logo and brand assets and the screenshots remain the property of their owners and are
provided here for the sole purpose of illustrating the work described in
README.md.

No permission is granted to deploy, reuse, redistribute, sublicense or
repurpose the code, the imagery, the Reconnect.iA name or its brand assets.
The written case study (README.md, SECURITY.md, platform/README.md) may be
quoted with attribution to the author.
